[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3661.03, "timestamp": "01:01:01", "text": "他们把拖车改造成了一种……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3664.95, "timestamp": "01:01:04", "text": "原版托普勒的视觉复制品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3667.27, "timestamp": "01:01:07", "text": "兄弟，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3669.51, "timestamp": "01:01:09", "text": "唯一遗憾的是他们做不到的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3673.51, "timestamp": "01:01:13", "text": "比如把原声音乐放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3674.99, "timestamp": "01:01:14", "text": "汤姆怎么样了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3677.829, "timestamp": "01:01:17", "text": "克鲁兹？实际上，他们也很遗憾地把这一点也写了下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3680.069, "timestamp": "01:01:20", "text": "做不到。他们不太擅长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3681.91, "timestamp": "01:01:21", "text": "人类，因为你知道这款游戏不是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3685.27, "timestamp": "01:01:25", "text": "有人类。入伍者确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3686.95, "timestamp": "01:01:26", "text": "但即使在入伍人员中，如果你仔细观察……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3688.63, "timestamp": "01:01:28", "text": "他们的表情，我觉得你做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3699.19, "timestamp": "01:01:39", "text": "现在，即使我们正在比赛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3701.71, "timestamp": "01:01:41", "text": "街机模式，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3704.99, "timestamp": "01:01:44", "text": "嗯，有些事情是现实的。为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3708.63, "timestamp": "01:01:48", "text": "例如，如果你……你的燃料可能会耗尽。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3711.71, "timestamp": "01:01:51", "text": "继续使用氮气加速"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3716.43, "timestamp": "01:01:56", "text": "力量。你的发动机机油可能会烧焦，请尽快处理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3718.789, "timestamp": "01:01:58", "text": "过热。如果你一直坚持"}]